---
---

<section class="relative min-h-[96vh] flex items-center justify-center text-white overflow-hidden pt-28 pb-16">
  
  <!-- Cinematic Moving Video: Benidorm & Costa Blanca Aerial Mix -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <video 
      autoplay 
      loop 
      muted 
      playsinline 
      poster="/images/hero-benidorm-poster.jpg" 
      class="w-full h-full object-cover scale-105"
    >
      <source src="/videos/hero-benidorm-costa-blanca.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>
    
    <!-- Cinematic Dark Gradient Overlay (Alfa Interiorismo Style) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/75 via-black/50 to-black/85"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Content Container -->
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 relative z-10 text-center w-full">
    
    <!-- Top Location Pill -->
    <div class="fade-up inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-black/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-gold-500/40 text-gold-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase mb-6 shadow-lg">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gold-400 animate-ping"></span>
      <span>Benidorm · Altea · Calpe · Costa Blanca</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Bold Headline (Alfa Interiorismo Style) -->
    <h1 class="fade-up delay-100 text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1.12] mb-6 drop-shadow-md">
      Construcción y Reformas <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 via-gold-500 to-amber-200">
        Integrales en Benidorm
      </span>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subtitle -->
    <p class="fade-up delay-200 text-sm sm:text-lg md:text-xl text-white/90 max-w-3xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed mb-10 drop-shadow-sm">
      Especialistas en reformas integrales de viviendas, chalets, cocinas y baños en Benidorm y toda la provincia de Alicante. Proyectos llave en mano con dirección técnica propia.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs (Alfa Style) -->
    <div class="fade-up delay-300 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mb-16">
      <a 
        href="#contacto" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-9 py-4 rounded-sm text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-black bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-400 via-gold-500 to-gold-600 hover:from-gold-500 hover:to-gold-400 shadow-xl shadow-gold-500/25 transition-all duration-300 transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 text-center"
      >
        Obtener Presupuesto!
      </a>
      <a 
        href="#proyectos" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto px-9 py-4 rounded-sm text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-white bg-black/50 hover:bg-black/75 border border-white/30 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 text-center flex items-center justify-center gap-2"
      >
        <span>Ver Vídeos de Obras</span>
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-gold-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z"></path>
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- 3 Signature Value Pillars (Direct from Alfa Interiorismo) -->
    <div class="fade-up delay-400 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-left">
      
      <div class="bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-sm border-l-4 border-gold-500 border-t border-r border-b border-white/10 shadow-lg group hover:bg-black/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-500 tracking-wider uppercase">01 / Modalidad</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">Proyecto Integral</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Diseño, coordinación de gremios, permisos y entrega llave en mano sin intermediarios.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-sm border-l-4 border-gold-500 border-t border-r border-b border-white/10 shadow-lg group hover:bg-black/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-500 tracking-wider uppercase">02 / Seguridad</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">Garantía por Contrato</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Presupuesto cerrado sin sorpresas y fecha de finalización pactada por contrato oficial.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-md p-6 rounded-sm border-l-4 border-gold-500 border-t border-r border-b border-white/10 shadow-lg group hover:bg-black/80 transition-colors">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gold-500 tracking-wider uppercase">03 / Flexibilidad</span>
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wide">Pago por Etapas</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70 mt-1 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Pagos vinculados a certificaciones de obra comprobadas. Transparencia total.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
